hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1328","Muhammad bin Yahya told us, Abu Al-Walid told us, on the authority of Al-Zafarani, on the authority of Affan bin Muslim, they said: Hammad told us, on the authority of Humaid, on the authority of Al-Hasan, on the authority of Uthman bin Abi Al-Aas, “The Thaqif delegation came to the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, and he brought them into the mosque so that it would be more elegant.” For their hearts"
